      "body": "SOURCE: The Evaluator\nSTATUS: Unresolved\n\nYou want to know why I am doing this? Of course you do. Everyone wants to listen once the alarms are sounding. Nobody wants to listen when the reports are being ignored, when the warnings are inconvenient, when the person speaking is easier to remove than to understand.\n\nSo now we are all taking a test.\n\nGo and save your precious little stations. Scurry from one bright monument to UFN certainty to the next. Download the files I have left for you and read them carefully. Slowly, if necessary. Read them the way they should have read mine.\n\nBy the time this is over, you may begin to understand what I endured from the UFN and its parade of polished, promoted incompetents.\n\nAnd remember: I am evaluating you. Combat readiness is a core component of Federation service, so be careful. I have control of a substantial fleet of UFN vessels, all reprogrammed to reduce you to debris if your performance disappoints me.\n\nDid you know I used to help design aptitude tests for Scientific Corps recruits?\n\nOf course, they never told the recruits that.\n\nPeople answer very differently when they think nobody is scoring them.\n\nThe funny thing is that my assessments worked.\n\nThe embarrassing thing is that some senior officers performed worse than the recruits.\n\nApparently they didn't appreciate seeing the results.\n\nLet's see how you do.\n\n--- YOUR FIRST TEST ---\n\nI answer every question.\n\nI repeat every secret.\n\nI speak with your voice,\nyet I have none of my own.\n\nWhat am I?"
