      "body": "CLASSIFICATION: INTERNAL\nSOURCE: UFN Echo\nSTATUS: Recovered\n\nCLASSIFICATION: INTERNAL\n\nThe following extract lists former members of the UFN Scientific Corps whose service concluded within the last three months.\n\nNAME: Amelia Cross\nPRONOUNS: she/her\nSPECIALISM: Propulsion Systems\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Long-Range Drive Calibration & Recruit Practical Evaluation Unit\nYEARS SERVED: 11\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: UFN Lantern\nSTATUS: Retired\n\nNAME: Adrian Vale\nPRONOUNS: he/him\nSPECIALISM: Communications Systems & Personnel Assessment Infrastructure\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Training Systems Support\nYEARS SERVED: 14\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: UFN Citadel\nSTATUS: Dismissed\n\nNAME: Marcus Shaw\nPRONOUNS: he/him\nSPECIALISM: Weapons Systems Research\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Tactical Ordnance Evaluation Cell\nYEARS SERVED: 16\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: UFN Atlas\nSTATUS: Dismissed\n\nNAME: Samuel Quinn\nPRONOUNS: he/him\nSPECIALISM: Communications & Encryption\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Fleet Training Communications Security & Aptitude Monitoring\nYEARS SERVED: 9\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: UFN Horizon\nSTATUS: Retired\n\nNAME: Ethan Ward\nPRONOUNS: he/him\nSPECIALISM: Sensor Research\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Deep-Scan Sensor Trials & Candidate Response Measurement Group\nYEARS SERVED: 14\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: UFN Beacon\nSTATUS: Resigned\n\nNAME: Reuben Frost\nPRONOUNS: he/him\nSPECIALISM: Communications Data Systems & Personnel Assessment Infrastructure\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Personnel Assessment Records Integration\nYEARS SERVED: 12\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: UFN Summit\nSTATUS: Dismissed\n\nNAME: Victor Hale\nPRONOUNS: he/him\nSPECIALISM: Propulsion Systems\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Civilian Drive Safety Liaison & Certification Assessment\nYEARS SERVED: 20\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: Civilian Space\nSTATUS: Retired\n\nNAME: Elena Price\nPRONOUNS: they/them\nSPECIALISM: Energy Systems\nFORMER ASSIGNMENT: Station Reactor Efficiency & Competency Review Programme\nYEARS SERVED: 12\nLAST KNOWN LOCATION: UFN Compass\nSTATUS: Transferred\n\nEND RECORD"
