      "body": "CLASSIFICATION: RECOVERED DEVICE TELEMETRY\nSOURCE: UFN Echo\nSTATUS: Recovered\n\nEVALUATOR DEVICE REPORT\n\nDEVICE_ID..........EV-117\nPOWER_STATE........ACTIVE\nAUTH_HASH..........551882\nCACHE_INDEX........118822\nREMOTE_LINK........ACTIVE\nMEM_BUFFER.........772118\nAUTH_HASH..........991287\nTIMER_STATE........ARMED\nROUTING_NODE.......117822\nAUTH_HASH..........662881\nDISARM_CODE........482731\nNODE_STATUS........ONLINE\nAUTH_HASH..........771928\nREMOTE_ACCESS......DENIED\nSYNC_STATE.........ACTIVE\nCACHE_INDEX........177822\nAUTH_HASH..........882117\nCHKSUM.............441822\nFAILSAFE...........ENABLED\nMEM_BUFFER.........118722\nAUTH_HASH..........772881\nAUTH_HASH..........117228\nCACHE_INDEX........661172\nMEM_BUFFER.........991728\nAUTH_HASH..........881772\nROUTING_NODE.......ACTIVE\nNODE_STATUS........ONLINE\nDEVICE_STATUS......ARMED\n\nEND REPORT"
