      "body": "CLASSIFICATION: RECOVERED DEVICE TELEMETRY\nSOURCE: UFN Horizon\nSTATUS: Recovered\n\nEVALUATOR DEVICE REPORT\n\nDEVICE_ID..........EV-224\nPOWER_STATE........ACTIVE\nCACHE_INDEX........440128\nREMOTE_ACCESS......DENIED\nAUTH_HASH..........814220\nSYNC_STATE.........ACTIVE\nMEM_BUFFER.........228914\nAUTH_HASH..........774128\nROUTING_NODE.......224771\nTIMER_STATE........ARMED\nAUTH_HASH..........228714\nCACHE_INDEX........552914\nAUTH_HASH..........118774\nNODE_STATUS........ONLINE\nREMOTE_LINK........ACTIVE\nMEM_BUFFER.........440224\nAUTH_HASH..........664291\nFAILSAFE...........ENABLED\nCHKSUM.............772640\nAUTH_HASH..........991884\nAUTH_HASH..........224118\nCACHE_INDEX........817240\nMEM_BUFFER.........664552\nAUTH_HASH..........552118\nROUTING_NODE.......ACTIVE\nDISARM_CODE........739204\nAUTH_HASH..........991420\nNODE_STATUS........ONLINE\nDEVICE_STATUS......ARMED\n\nEND REPORT"
