      "group": "2: Intel from Faraday",
      "body": "Source: UFN Faraday Materials Lab\nRule 1: Iron > 50%\nRule 2: [REDACTED]\nRule 3: [REDACTED]\nRedaction authority: Professor Calder\nRedaction timestamp: 2249-11-03 02:17 UFN\n\nThe matching artefact sample can be identified by comparing returned sample-probe composition reports against these rules.\n\nThe correct material sample must satisfy all three conditions:\n\n1. Iron makes up more than half of the material.\n2. [REDACTED - Calder authorisation required]\n3. [REDACTED - Calder authorisation required]\n\nOnly one surveyed artefact is expected to match all three conditions.\n\nComposition reports list only Iron, Copper and [REDACTED]. Compare the numbers carefully; \"close enough\" remains not a scientific category, despite Aldred's continued lobbying.\n\nRedaction audit: Redacted by Professor Calder, UFN Faraday, 2249-11-03 02:17 UFN."
