      "trigger": "Faraday database release",
      "group": "2: Intel from Faraday",
      "body": "Source: UFN Faraday Survey Archive\nSurvey count: 8 artefacts\nLocations: [REDACTED]\nRedaction authority: Professor Calder\nRedaction timestamp: 2249-11-03 02:17 UFN\n\nUFN Faraday regional artefact survey.\n\nThe research team catalogued eight major artefacts before station operations failed. Positions are provided as tactical sectors with raw coordinates for waypoint confirmation.\n\nARTEFACT 01 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\nARTEFACT 02 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\nARTEFACT 03 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\nARTEFACT 04 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\nARTEFACT 05 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\nARTEFACT 06 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\nARTEFACT 07 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\nARTEFACT 08 - Sector [REDACTED] - Coordinates [REDACTED]\n\nRedaction audit: Redacted by Professor Calder, UFN Faraday, 2249-11-03 02:17 UFN."
